/.vs
/bin/Debug
/native/upstream-trellis
/obj

# Two PE files exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit (ggml-cuda.dll 136 MiB,
# ggml-vulkan.dll 40 MiB), so they stay out of history. They are produced by
# .github/workflows/build-trellis.yml under out/runtimes/win-x64/native and
# fetched from that run's artifact, or by a local trellis build, before packing.
# SeasonThreeD.csproj still globs them - a staged copy is packed into the NuGet
# package and copied to the output exactly as before; ignoring them only keeps
# them out of the commit. Everything else under runtimes/ is tracked.
/runtimes/win-x64/native/ggml-cuda.dll
/runtimes/win-x64/native/ggml-vulkan.dll
